<title>JAPAN: RESEARCH ALERT - Maruzen Showa rated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Maruzen Showa rated.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Daiwa Institute of Research</p>
<p>Ltd has assigned Maruzen Showa Unyu Co Ltd a &quot;B&quot; rating,</p>
<p>Daiwa Securities brokers said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In its three-grade rating system, the research institute</p>
<p>assigns a &quot;B&quot; rating to issues whose values it sees</p>
<p>moving within 10 percentage points in either direction of</p>
<p>the Tokyo Stock Exchange first-section TOPIX index over the</p>
<p>next six months.</p>
</text>
